<title>USA: Conoco participated in Santa Fe bidding.</title>
<headline>Conoco participated in Santa Fe bidding.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co's Conoco Inc participated in the bidding for Santa Fe Exploration Ltd, spokeswoman Tersea Wong said.</p>
<p>&quot;That process has ended,&quot; she said of the bidding for the United Kingdom oil and natural gas company owned by Kuwait's national oil company.</p>
<p>&quot;We're awaiting a final decision,&quot; Wong said, adding any further statement would have to come from Santa Fe in London.</p>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp said last summer it was putting Santa Fe on the block. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
